RUN: not %COMPILE --error-format clang build plc.json 2>&1 | %CHECK %s

The block is the fault, so the diagnostic names its diagram and execution
order and no pin index follows.
CHECK: {{.*}}action_no_instance.cfc.action_no_instance:1: error[E159]: Action block `counter.increment` has no instance to run on
CHECK: error: Compilation aborted due to critical errors
